# CSS cascade layers

Declare the library's cascade layers in one place, ordered so later library layers override earlier ones. Put component modules in the component layer. Put tokens in the token layer via a layered import, not a layer block inside the token file. Keep resets in the reset layer. Leave font-face rules unlayered, because the spec does not allow them inside a layer. Application CSS stays unlayered, so it wins over the library without `!important`. Do not add a new top-level layer without updating the single declaration.
